## Questions and answers

### Orders & delivery

**How long does delivery take?**

We dispatch every order within 1 to 2 working days. After that, most parcels arrive in 3 to 7 days, depending on where you live. The [Shipping policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/policies/shipping-policy) has the details.

**What does delivery cost?**

Shipping is free on orders over ₹299. Below that, it's ₹79.

**Where do you deliver?**

Anywhere in India that our couriers reach. We do not deliver outside India yet.

**How do I track my order?**

We send you a tracking link by email, SMS or WhatsApp as soon as your parcel is with the courier. You can also follow it from [Track your order]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/track-order).

**Can I change or cancel my order?**

Yes, until it is dispatched, which is usually within 1 to 2 working days. Message us quickly with your order number from the [Contact page]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/contact). Once a parcel is with the courier, its address can no longer be changed and it can no longer be cancelled.

### Returns & refunds

**My order arrived damaged, or something is wrong. What now?**

Tell us within 48 hours of delivery, with an unboxing video or clear photos of the parcel being opened. We will send a replacement or give you a full refund. WhatsApp is the quickest way, because it can carry photos and videos. The [Refund policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/policies/refund-policy) has the details.

**Can I return a piece if I change my mind?**

No. Every piece is made by hand, and many are gifts, so we do not take returns or exchanges for a change of mind. If you are unsure about a size or colour, ask us before you order: we are glad to help.

**How and when are refunds paid?**

To your original payment method, within 5 to 7 working days of our approving it. Your bank may take a few more days to show it.

### Our pieces

**Is everything really handmade?**

Yes. Every bouquet, keychain, hair clip and bag charm is crocheted by hand in India, one stitch at a time.

**Will my piece look exactly like the photo?**

Very close, but not identical. Each piece is made individually, so small differences in size, shape, stitch and shade are natural. Colours can also look a little different from one screen to another.

**Will the colours fade?**

Crochet never wilts and needs no water. Keep your pieces out of strong direct sunlight and their colours stay bright for years.

**How do I care for my crochet?**

Hand wash in cool water. Press gently, don't wring. Dry flat in the shade.

**Are the pieces safe for small children?**

Our pieces are decorative and gift items, not toys. Some have small parts such as keyrings, clips, beads or wire stems, so please keep them away from children under 3.

### Gifts & custom orders

**Can I add a gift note?**

Yes. In your cart, choose "Add a gift note" and write your message. We include it with your order.

**Can you make a custom or bulk order?**

Yes, gladly: your choice of colours, sizes or designs, names and initials, and larger orders for weddings, parties and gifting. We agree the details, price and timeline with you first, and start once it has been paid for. [See how custom orders work]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/custom-orders), or [tell us what you have in mind]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/contact?topic=custom#ContactForm).

### Payment & account

**How can I pay?**

With UPI, debit or credit cards, net banking and wallets, through our secure payment partner. We never see or store your card details. All prices include GST.

**Do I need an account to order?**

No. You can check out as a guest. If you sign in with the email you ordered with, you will see all your orders and their tracking in one place. There is no password: we email you a one-time code.

### Custom orders

**How early should I ask?**

As early as you can. Each piece is crocheted by hand, so the bigger the order, the longer it takes. Tell us your date first, and Priya will say plainly whether she can meet it.

**What does a custom order cost?**

It depends on the piece, the size and the number. We give you the price before anything is made, and you decide then.

**When do I pay?**

Before Priya starts. A custom piece is made only for you, so we begin once it has been paid for.

**Can a custom order be returned or cancelled?**

If it arrives damaged or is not what we agreed, yes: tell us within 48 hours of delivery with an unboxing video or clear photos, and we replace it or refund you. Otherwise a piece made only for you cannot be returned, exchanged or, once Priya has started it, cancelled. Our [refund policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/policies/refund-policy) has the details.

### About Shop

**Is everything in the shop handmade?**

Yes. Every piece is crocheted by hand by Priya. Nothing is made by machine or bought in from a factory.

**Do you take custom and bulk orders?**

Yes. Message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page with what you have in mind, how many you need and the date.

**How do I look after crochet?**

Hand wash it in cool water, press the water out gently without wringing, and dry it flat in the shade. Keep it out of strong direct sunlight.

### About Crochet Bouquets

**How long does a crochet flower bouquet last?**

For years. Crochet flowers do not wilt, dry out or drop petals, and they need no water. Keep the bouquet out of strong direct sunlight and its colours stay bright.

**Does the bouquet come wrapped?**

Yes. Every bouquet is wrapped in black and gold and tied with a ribbon before it is packed, so it is ready to give when it arrives.

**Can I choose the flowers or the colours?**

Many bouquets have a choice of colour or of the third flower on their page. For anything else, such as other colours or a bigger bouquet, message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page and Priya will tell you what she can make.

**Can crochet flowers be washed?**

Yes, gently. Take the flowers out of their wrap first so the wrap stays dry, then hand wash them in cool water, press the water out without wringing, and dry them flat in the shade.

### About Crochet Keychains

**What is the keychain attached to?**

Every keychain comes on a metal ring with a short chain. It goes on a key ring, a bag strap, a pencil case or the pull of a zip.

**How do I wash a crochet keychain?**

Hand wash it in cool water, press the water out gently without wringing, and let it dry flat in the shade. Dry the metal ring with a cloth afterwards.

**Can I order many keychains as return gifts?**

Yes. Keychains make good return gifts for birthdays and weddings. Message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page with the number you need and the date, and Priya will tell you how long it will take.

**Is each keychain exactly like the photo?**

Very close, but not identical. Each one is crocheted by hand, so a petal or a smile may sit a little differently. The colours and the design are the ones you see.

### About Crochet Hair Accessories

**Are these for children or for adults?**

Both. The clips and pins are light and small enough for a child, and the headbands tie at the back, so they fit any head. The claw clips are best for longer hair.

**Will the crochet flower come off the clip?**

Each flower is fixed to its clip, pin or band by hand. Treat it as you would any hair clip: open it by the clip, not by pulling on the flower.

**How do I clean crochet hair clips?**

Wipe the flower with a damp cloth, or wash it gently by hand in cool water and dry it flat in the shade. Dry the metal clip with a cloth so it stays bright.

### About Crochet Bag Charms

**How does the charm attach to a bag?**

It ties on. Knot its green cord around a bag handle, a strap ring or a zip pull, and the two bell flowers hang below.

**Can I wear it in my hair?**

Yes. Tie it over a hair tie around a ponytail or at the end of a plait. One of our photos shows it worn this way.

**Can you make the charm in other colours?**

Pink and white are the colours we keep ready. For another colour, or for a number of charms for a wedding or a party, message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page.

### About Crochet Flower Pots

**Does the crochet pot stand up by itself?**

Yes. It is made to stand upright by itself on a desk, a shelf or a windowsill, without a vase or any support.

**Is the pot real, or is it crochet too?**

It is crochet too. The pot, the soil, the leaves and the flower are all crocheted by hand from yarn.

**How do I keep it clean?**

Dust it with a soft dry brush or cloth now and then. If it needs more, wipe it with a damp cloth and let it dry in the shade. Keep it out of strong direct sunlight so the colours stay bright.

### About Crochet Home Decor

**How does the curtain tie-back fasten?**

It wraps around the gathered curtain and fastens behind the sunflower, so only the flower and its leaves show from the front.

**How many tie-backs do I need?**

One for each curtain panel. A window with two curtains needs a pack of two, and two windows need a pack of four.

**Will the colours fade near a window?**

Yarn keeps its colour well indoors. Strong direct sunlight for hours every day can soften any colour over time, so a window that gets shade or filtered light is best.

### About Crochet Sunflowers

**What does a sunflower mean as a gift?**

Warmth, happiness and loyalty. People give sunflowers to wish someone well, to say thank you and to celebrate a friendship, so they suit most occasions.

**Which sunflower piece is the smallest gift?**

The sunflower keychain and the pair of sunflower hair clips are the smallest. The single sunflower bouquet is the smallest bouquet.

**Do crochet sunflowers fade?**

Not in normal use. They never wilt and need no water. Keep them out of strong direct sunlight and the yellow stays bright for years.

### About Crochet Roses

**Which colour of rose should I give?**

Red roses are for love and anniversaries. Pink says thank you or shows affection, and suits a mother, a sister or a friend. Yellow is the colour of friendship and good wishes.

**Is a crochet rose a good anniversary or Valentine's gift?**

Yes. It is a rose that does not die after a week, and it can stay on a desk or a shelf for years.

**Does the rose have a scent?**

No. It is made of yarn, so it has no scent and no pollen, which also makes it a kind gift for someone with a pollen allergy.

### About Crochet Tulips

**What colours do the crochet tulips come in?**

The single tulip comes in pink, blue, lavender and white. The bouquets use those colours together, and each bouquet's page shows which.

**What does a tulip mean as a gift?**

Tulips stand for care and affection. Pink is for good wishes, white for a fresh start or an apology, and blue and lavender are simply calm, pretty colours.

**Can I make my own mix of tulips?**

The blue tulip bouquet lets you choose its third flower. For any other mix, or more stems, message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page and Priya will make it for you if she can.

### About Crochet Daisies

**What does a daisy mean as a gift?**

Cheerfulness, new beginnings and true friendship. It is a light, happy flower to give, without the weight of a red rose.

**Which daisy pieces can I wear?**

The blue daisy headband, the daisy hair clips and the daisy claw clip are made to be worn. The daisy keychain goes on a bag or keys.

**Will a white daisy stay white?**

Yes, with a little care. Keep it away from dust and strong sunlight. If it needs cleaning, hand wash it in cool water, press it gently and dry it flat in the shade.

### About Gift Sets

**Is a set cheaper than buying the pieces one by one?**

Usually, yes. Most of our keychain and hair sets cost less than the same pieces bought one by one. Each set's page shows its price, so you can compare.

**Can I make my own set?**

Yes. Message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page with the pieces and colours you want, and Priya will tell you what it will cost and when it can be ready.

**Can a set be split between people?**

Yes. In keychain sets every keychain is a separate piece on its own ring, so one set can become two or three small gifts.

### About Birthday Gifts

**Which crochet gift is best for a best friend's birthday?**

A bouquet in their favourite flower. If you want something they will carry every day, a keychain pair is a good choice: one for them and one for you.

**Will it arrive in time for the birthday?**

Each product page shows how soon the piece is sent, and the Shipping policy gives the delivery times. Since crochet does not wilt, it is safe to order a week or two early.

**Can you send it straight to the birthday person?**

Yes. Enter their address as the delivery address at checkout. The parcel is packed by hand and ready to open.

### About Anniversary Gifts

**Is a crochet rose bouquet a good anniversary gift?**

Yes. It carries the meaning of roses and it does not wilt, so it becomes a keepsake of the day.

**How many roses should I give?**

One rose is simple and personal. Two stand for a couple. Three make a full bouquet. All three are here, so choose by what suits the person.

**Can I order a bigger bouquet?**

Yes. For more roses than our bouquets hold, or for particular colours, message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page a little ahead of the date.

### About Thank You Gifts

**What is a good crochet gift for a teacher?**

A single flower bouquet or a flower pot for the desk are two good choices. A sunflower stands for warmth and gratitude, which suits a teacher well.

**I need thank you gifts for many people. Can you help?**

Yes. For a class, an office or wedding guests, message us on WhatsApp or through the Contact page with the number and the date, and Priya will tell you what is possible.

**What is the smallest gift here?**

The keychains and the single flower bouquets. Sort the page by price, low to high, to see them first.

### About Gifts for Her

**What do I give a girl who already has everything?**

Something made by hand that she can keep: a crochet bouquet in her favourite flower. It is not something she will have seen in a shop.

**Which gift is good for a sister?**

A bag charm, a hair set or a keychain pair. They are small, she will use them, and a pair lets you keep one too.

**Do girls like crochet flowers?**

In our experience, yes. They are flowers that last, they are made by hand, and each one took real time to make, which is most of what makes a gift feel special.

### About Gifts under ₹299

**What is the cheapest handmade gift you have?**

The flower hair clips, then the single keychains and the bag charm. Sort this page by price, low to high, to see today's prices.

**Are the cheaper pieces also handmade?**

Yes. Every piece, whatever its price, is crocheted by hand by Priya. The smaller ones simply take less time and yarn.

**Is delivery free on a small order?**

Delivery is free from the amount shown in your cart, and below it there is a small delivery fee. Adding a second small gift is often enough to reach it.

### About Bestsellers

**What is your most popular crochet gift?**

The sunflower bouquet. It comes with one, two or three sunflowers, wrapped in black and gold, and suits almost any occasion.

**Is everything really handmade?**

Yes. Every bouquet, keychain, flower pot and charm is crocheted by hand in Piro, Bihar. There is no machine and no factory.

**Do you deliver across India?**

Yes, anywhere in India that our couriers reach. Our Shipping policy gives the delivery times.

### About Gifts for Him

**What crochet gift can I give my boyfriend?**

A keychain pair, so each of you carries one. The evil eye pair and the bee and chick pair are both made for this.

**Is there a crochet gift for a brother?**

Yes. An evil eye keychain for his bike or car keys is a good choice, and it suits Raksha Bandhan and Bhai Dooj as a gift from a sister.

**Can a man be given crochet flowers?**

Of course. A sunflower bouquet or a flower pot for his desk is a warm gift for a father, a teacher or a friend. You will find them on our bouquet and flower pot pages.

### About Crochet Flowers

**Do crochet flowers last?**

Yes, for years. They do not wilt, dry out or drop petals, and they need no water. Keep them out of strong direct sunlight and the colours stay bright.

**Are crochet flowers made by hand or by machine?**

By hand. Crochet is done with a hook, one stitch at a time, and every flower here is made by Priya.

**Which crochet flower should I give?**

Each flower's own page says what it stands for. As a quick guide: a sunflower for warmth, a rose for love, and a mixed bouquet when you cannot decide.

**Can I ask for a flower you do not show?**

Ask us. Message us on WhatsApp or through the Custom orders page with what you have in mind, and Priya will tell you what she can make.

### About Evil Eye Crochet Keychains

**What does an evil eye keychain mean as a gift?**

It is a wish for protection and good luck. Giving one says you want the person kept safe, which is why people choose it for new vehicles, new homes and new beginnings.

**Can I use it for my car or my bike?**

Yes. It hangs on a metal ring and chain, so it goes on car keys, bike keys, a bag or a zip.

**Is the evil eye keychain for men or for women?**

Both. The blue and white suits anyone, which is why you will also find it on our Gifts for Him page.

### About Return Gifts

**How many return gifts can I order?**

As many as you need, with enough notice. The cart limits how many of one piece you can add, so for a larger number message us on WhatsApp or through the Custom orders page with the count and your date.

**How early should I order return gifts for a wedding or a party?**

As early as you can. Each piece is crocheted by hand, so a big order takes time to make, depending on the piece and the number. Tell us your date first and Priya will say whether she can meet it.

**Which crochet return gift suits children?**

The bee and the chick keychains, and the flower hair clips. They are small, soft and bright.

**Can every guest get the same colour?**

Usually, yes. Tell us the colour when you message us and Priya will confirm before she starts.

### About Teacher's Day Gifts

**Which flower is right for a teacher?**

A sunflower is a safe choice: it stands for warmth and gratitude. A daisy or a tulip suits just as well.

**Can a whole class order together?**

Yes. For one gift from the class, choose a larger bouquet. For one small piece for each student or each teacher, message us on WhatsApp or through the Custom orders page with the number and the date.

**Will it reach us before Teacher's Day?**

Order early. Each piece is made by hand and then travels by courier. The delivery times are on every product page, so check them before you order.

**Is a keychain too small a gift for a teacher?**

No. It is used every day and it was made by hand, and that is what a teacher remembers.

### About Friendship Day Gifts

**What is a good crochet gift for a best friend?**

A matching pair of keychains, so each of you carries one. The octopus pair and the bee and chick pair are both made to be split.

**Is there a gift for a whole group of friends?**

Yes. A set of three keychains gives one each to three friends, and a pack of heart hair pins has enough pairs to share around.

**Is there a Friendship Day gift for a boy?**

Yes. The evil eye, the bee and the octopus keychains suit anyone.

### About Valentine's Day Gifts

**Can I give crochet flowers to my boyfriend?**

Yes. Flowers that last are a gift for anyone. If he would rather carry something, choose a keychain pair and keep the other one yourself.

**Will my order come before Valentine's Day?**

Order well ahead: every piece is made by hand and then sent by courier. Each product page shows the delivery times.

**Is the bouquet ready to give when it arrives?**

Yes. Every bouquet is wrapped in black and gold and tied with a ribbon before it is packed.

**Is a crochet rose better than a real one?**

It is different. A real rose has a scent and lasts a few days. A crochet rose has no scent, was made by hand, and lasts for years.

### About Rakhi Gifts

**Do you make crochet rakhis?**

No, not at present. This page is for gifts to give with a rakhi, or in return for one.

